00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:51.480
Strictly non-commercial,
not selling anything.

00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:54.160
I just put up as a public service,
as a labor of love,

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:56.640
as a tribute to my grandmother

00:14:56.640 --> 00:15:00.400
whose own life was saved
with evidence-based nutrition.

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:01.840
Thanks for listening.

